{
  "applied_operation_id": "op_d337ff31220b455fb492265d674b36c1",
  "claims": [
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_1cf27595c5566683e6ec00f65671a5e091abfea36982c20dac59f54a8c5bfcfb",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "specifications",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "a216364ea2dbb208e6501468c5e5b791594cc3d5",
          "git_sha": "ab4206d9934ffd6a245e2fcc9370f033a831efc0",
          "line_end": 21,
          "line_start": 21,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "101dotxyz/gpteam",
          "url": "https://github.com/101dotxyz/GPTeam/blob/a216364ea2dbb208e6501468c5e5b791594cc3d5/README.md#L21-L21"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_1895463559eb993f2b591df2e8a4fc90b19ce086ee13786b0992c4977e53372a"
      ],
      "text": "GPTeam uses GPT-4 to create multiple agents that collaborate to achieve predefined goals, aiming to explore GPT models' potential for multi-agent productivity and communication."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_9effc15bd611862f9b34dc1caad046decaf2d1c8fc0ac9d394b01279358cace3",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "components",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "a216364ea2dbb208e6501468c5e5b791594cc3d5",
          "git_sha": "ab4206d9934ffd6a245e2fcc9370f033a831efc0",
          "line_end": 43,
          "line_start": 43,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "101dotxyz/gpteam",
          "url": "https://github.com/101dotxyz/GPTeam/blob/a216364ea2dbb208e6501468c5e5b791594cc3d5/README.md#L43-L43"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_751b491d285baad6ccfcfb1f416c64121d89470d476288e045622888a391dd6e"
      ],
      "text": "Each agent has its own memory and uses communication as a tool; agent memory and reflection are inspired by a cited research paper (arXiv 2304.03442)."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_9daa50338107ff699ba6e9127d46b042e5a2625eec6f34e4b2afd4bdcbde98d1",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "orchestration",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "a216364ea2dbb208e6501468c5e5b791594cc3d5",
          "git_sha": "ab4206d9934ffd6a245e2fcc9370f033a831efc0",
          "line_end": 43,
          "line_start": 43,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "101dotxyz/gpteam",
          "url": "https://github.com/101dotxyz/GPTeam/blob/a216364ea2dbb208e6501468c5e5b791594cc3d5/README.md#L43-L43"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_751b491d285baad6ccfcfb1f416c64121d89470d476288e045622888a391dd6e"
      ],
      "text": "Agents move around the world, perform tasks in different locations depending on their activity and other agents' positions, and can speak to each other and collaborate on tasks in parallel."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_8f96e7e793fad84452f741e87c2de3ea7568e9ac4623487ecda4e1de36eee36e",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "interfaces",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "a216364ea2dbb208e6501468c5e5b791594cc3d5",
          "git_sha": "ab4206d9934ffd6a245e2fcc9370f033a831efc0",
          "line_end": 55,
          "line_start": 53,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "101dotxyz/gpteam",
          "url": "https://github.com/101dotxyz/GPTeam/blob/a216364ea2dbb208e6501468c5e5b791594cc3d5/README.md#L53-L55"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_bd1eef9ab3c25a25a4a90edc96b9b920dc16b798ce813bb46def205dca6baccc"
      ],
      "text": "The world is configured via a config.json file listing available agents and locations; after editing it, users reset the database and relaunch the world."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_0dfb3000c6bce7b9f4e983f460679c1aaa4107d3f595df810ec086aa159562e0",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "interfaces",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "a216364ea2dbb208e6501468c5e5b791594cc3d5",
          "git_sha": "ab4206d9934ffd6a245e2fcc9370f033a831efc0",
          "line_end": 47,
          "line_start": 47,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "101dotxyz/gpteam",
          "url": "https://github.com/101dotxyz/GPTeam/blob/a216364ea2dbb208e6501468c5e5b791594cc3d5/README.md#L47-L47"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_c651a4edeb262b60e68be90057273ec3820937cb5ce054adbc34bc0ef7376efe"
      ],
      "text": "While the world runs, each agent's current state is written to a text file in the agents/ folder, letting users observe what agents are doing."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_4c613ada48f3bb0afd4be8f9e0c88789e7cb61016be21813a3cc1825208a9b6e",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "dependencies",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "a216364ea2dbb208e6501468c5e5b791594cc3d5",
          "git_sha": "ab4206d9934ffd6a245e2fcc9370f033a831efc0",
          "line_end": 35,
          "line_start": 31,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "101dotxyz/gpteam",
          "url": "https://github.com/101dotxyz/GPTeam/blob/a216364ea2dbb208e6501468c5e5b791594cc3d5/README.md#L31-L35"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_0f313781cdef57ece96678d8f08975c444f83e4bb76a50a8b79da7631ceeb8fb"
      ],
      "text": "The project requires an OpenAI API key in .env; supplying keys for optional services enables additional tools, and the project is managed with Poetry."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_9475ffb2e42d460f17b245b53b7db8b5611fcc8546307e95910439ba5c34e2b5",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "design-choices",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "a216364ea2dbb208e6501468c5e5b791594cc3d5",
          "git_sha": "ab4206d9934ffd6a245e2fcc9370f033a831efc0",
          "line_end": 37,
          "line_start": 37,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "101dotxyz/gpteam",
          "url": "https://github.com/101dotxyz/GPTeam/blob/a216364ea2dbb208e6501468c5e5b791594cc3d5/README.md#L37-L37"
        },
        {
          "commit": "a216364ea2dbb208e6501468c5e5b791594cc3d5",
          "git_sha": "ab4206d9934ffd6a245e2fcc9370f033a831efc0",
          "line_end": 63,
          "line_start": 63,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "101dotxyz/gpteam",
          "url": "https://github.com/101dotxyz/GPTeam/blob/a216364ea2dbb208e6501468c5e5b791594cc3d5/README.md#L63-L63"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_aae23d9affee5874ecbc329118001d4d1c3e4649befa101f6a89b1695b958a1a",
        "slc_e4651380b05ec1deb47402f7b3ac4d751f079e32326a7564394dfbf02b082d8f"
      ],
      "text": "A --turbo flag runs all LLM calls with gpt3.5-turbo for lower cost, at the cost of worse results; a --claude flag uses claude-v1 and claude-v1-instant for some calls."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_5e73729f5f75557f071987b963f5d208d9f4cab32f3c0329281a5417ec006634",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "interfaces",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "a216364ea2dbb208e6501468c5e5b791594cc3d5",
          "git_sha": "ee58abba8d45052ad5db412bca6c2148d10c9e1b",
          "line_end": 8,
          "line_start": 3,
          "path": "DISCORD.md",
          "repository": "101dotxyz/gpteam",
          "url": "https://github.com/101dotxyz/GPTeam/blob/a216364ea2dbb208e6501468c5e5b791594cc3d5/DISCORD.md#L3-L8"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_2c78181df394fd0fd245430b95e3e681dc47c305236f13c8a04a94e01ecee9c6"
      ],
      "text": "In the Discord integration, each world maps to a Discord guild, each location to a channel, each agent to a separate bot application, plus an announcer bot that announces agent movement between rooms."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_3a0733c8f0467b61f304c90ef7e1da85b21811d5c0f521d09ca2b5429858a6d5",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "workflows",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
